IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STRING-CONCEPT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  01 WS-DATE   PIC X(10) VALUE "2026/11/15".
  01 WS-YEAR   PIC X(4).
  01 WS-MONTH  PIC X(2).
  01 WS-DAY    PIC X(2).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      UNSTRING WS-DATE DELIMITED BY "/"
            INTO WS-YEAR
            WS-MONTH
            WS-DAY
      END-UNSTRING.
      DISPLAY WS-YEAR.
      DISPLAY WS-MONTH.
      DISPLAY WS-DAY.
STOP RUN.
